//: # check/expr/stage1_match_actual_direct_fixture
//: actual VFS Match のdirect call、明示ascription、pipeを検証するstage1専用fixtureです。
//:
//: neplg2:test
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target core
//:| #import "neplg2/core/check/expr/stage1_match_actual_direct_fixture" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     match selfhost_check_expr_stage1_fixture_match_actual_direct_only:
//:         true: 0
//:         false: 1
//: ```

